---
id: KelolaRole-TambahRole
title: Kelola Role - Tambah Role
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SA as Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI :boundary
    participant C as RoleController :control
    participant R as Role Model :entity
    participant DB as Database :entity

    SA->>UI: Klik tombol "Tambah Role"
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form input (nama role, deskripsi, pilih permissions)
    SA->>UI: Isi form dan klik Simpan
    UI->>C: POST /admin/roles
    note over C: Validasi: nama unik, nama tidak kosong
    alt Validasi berhasil
        C->>+R: Create role baru dengan name, description
        R->>+DB: INSERT INTO roles (name, description, created_at)
        DB-->>-R: Role berhasil disimpan
        note over C: Jika ada permissions terpilih, attach ke role
        C->>+R: Attach permissions ke role
        R->>+DB: INSERT INTO role_permission (role_id, permission_id) VALUES (...)
        DB-->>-R: Permissions berhasil di-attach
        R-->>C: New role instance dengan permissions
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>SA: Notifikasi berhasil, refresh daftar
    else Validasi gagal
        C-->>UI: Response error dengan pesan validasi
        UI-->>SA: Tampilkan pesan error
    end

